      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The system suspends your app’s Picture in Picture session when another app, typically FaceTime, is using the feature.",
      "ko": "The system suspends your app’s Picture in Picture session when another app, typically FaceTime, is using the feature.",
      "sourceHash": "b8ddcf5f3d784a44e890baacd805094130fa722632cea0da0b5573ff1926cf6d",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "In this state, your video playback is active but paused and offscreen.",
      "ko": "모든 관절과 해당 부모 관절에 대해 선을 그리면 기본 골격을 시각화할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "18c5b505eed7b5316a26b4ef104e6bc87c316e2313b9d35072809920f223d186",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Picture in Picture resumes automatically when the other app finishes using PiP.",
      "ko": "부모가 없는 관절은 루트 관절로 표시됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7be3a757457c226e93218417db677ad505b6a3571b2a94bab31487696ad018b6",
